From 0b08f64e231043e9208b281922d5841319da2257 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "HT9045 Machine (V906)" <Claude_RDBC_02@honprec.com>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 21:10:57 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] NOOVERLAP-A (web): Offset and Shuttle Sensor Utility overlaps
 removed (golden FormShow widths, alBottom, LED position)

EastSun 20260930: overlapping controls are not allowed.
- Setup.OffSet.html (67 -> 22): golden FormShow sets fOffSet->Width =
  pnlMain + pnlPicker + 5 (cOffSet.cpp:683), so the alRight pnlPicker sits
  next to the alLeft pnlMain. The design-time 1586 form had pnlPicker
  covering the right 146px of pnlMain. The form is now 1730 wide; pnlMain,
  pnlPicker and pnlIndexOfs are full height; Image2 is alClient; Panel5 is
  alBottom. Label5 / Label8 hidden (form TLabels under PageControl1).
  Pnl_ScanAOI / Pnl_AOI clip their children like a TPanel, and ck_ScanAOI
  unfolds Pnl_ScanAOI to 81/33 as golden ck_ScanAOIClick does.
  sbBGAView / sbPADView hidden (FormShow always hides them).
  sbInRotate / sbOutRotate moved a few px off sbInSh2LB / sbOutSh1RA.
  Left: 19 controls placed on the station / nozzle pictures that stick
  out past the picture's transparent margin by 1-5px, as in golden. And
  3 OUT-OF-WINDOW: the window (background.html, 1240x720) is narrower
  than the 1730x733 form.
- HW.MyCCLinkSensor.html (68 -> 0): palButton is alBottom; the 60 sensor
  LEDs moved from golden Top=8 (iLedVisiblePos) to 6, clear of the tray
  grids that start at 28; Panel2 ends at the sheet bottom.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 page/HW.MyCCLinkSensor.html |  5 ++++-
 page/Setup.OffSet.html      | 12 ++++++++++--
 2 files changed, 14 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/page/HW.MyCCLinkSensor.html b/page/HW.MyCCLinkSensor.html
index 8b13d5e..d26d919 100644
--- a/page/HW.MyCCLinkSensor.html
+++ b/page/HW.MyCCLinkSensor.html
@@ -49,11 +49,14 @@
   .lled{box-sizing:border-box;}
   .lled:hover{outline:1px dotted var(--gbx-border,#9aa);outline-offset:1px;}
   .lledCap{line-height:1.3;}
+  /* AI(W906-NOOVERLAP) 20260930：EastSun「很多頁面都有重疊的情況 這是不被允許的」—— 60 顆感測器 TALed（ledInSht1_*／ledInSht2_*／
+     SocketLED*／ColorLED*／MyLedLane17..20）在 golden 是 Top=8（ShowUseSensor 的 iLedVisiblePos，MyCCLinkSensor.cpp:1834）、高 22，
+     底下的 TTMyTray 從 Top=28 開始 → 燈壓在格盤上框 2px。燈改放 Top=6（Lane 燈 52→50），剛好貼在格盤上方，不再疊。 */
 </style>
 </head>
